# Rust build output
/target/
**/target/

# Soroban test snapshots (regenerated on every test run)
**/test_snapshots/

# Compiled contract artifacts
*.wasm

# cargo-fuzz corpus/artifacts (regenerated locally and by CI; the nightly
# job persists corpus via actions/cache, not git). Deliberately-committed
# crash regressions are the one exception — see CONTRIBUTING.md's
# "Fuzzing & crash-to-regression convention".
fuzz/corpus/*
!fuzz/corpus/*/
fuzz/corpus/*/*
!fuzz/corpus/*/regressions/
fuzz/artifacts/

# Environment / secrets — NEVER commit these
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# TypeScript build output
# TypeScript package build output (packages/*/dist)
packages/*/dist/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
